-- Smash history: majors from 2017 on that start.gg didn't feature (docs/archive-plan.md). Smashy's
-- archive from 2017 lists start.gg's featured tournaments, which misses majors the community counts
-- (Smash Summits, GENESIS 8 and 9, The Big House 10, Shine 2022, P+ and 64 majors, ...). The names and
-- dates come from Liquipedia's "Major Tournaments" lists (read 2026-11-17); each was looked up on start.gg
-- by its exact address (read-only, paced, 2026-11-19) and kept only when start.gg's dates agree within
-- five days. Ones Smashy already had under another address (parry.gg or another start.gg link) are left
-- out. The rows are what an admin featuring them would save (source 'admin'); the daily archive fill
-- then saves their top 8s, standings and sets. Project M events start.gg files under the old Project M
-- game (Blacklisted 3-5 and others) aren't here yet. Safe to run twice: existing majors are left alone.

insert into public.majors (slug, name, start_at, end_at, games, entrants, city, country, image_url, timezone, source, hidden)
